summary:
  A reading in flight runs to its end after the option is unticked.

history:
  With the option off the widget makes no connection on its behalf, the one
  already out included.

target:
  package/contents/ui/Loudness.qml

find:
      on_OnChanged: if (!_on) _end()

replace:
      on_OnChanged: if (!_on) settle.stop()

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudness.qml::test_unticking_the_option_ends_the_reading.
  Line-neutral.
